<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces continue to intercept and destroy explosive-laden drones in Kirkuk, while Iraqi officials meet with Trump to discuss regional security and reaffirm Iraq will not be used to attack neighboring countries. Iranian forces persist in targeting Kurdish opposition, including a missile found on an old drone that was defused in Kirkuk, and a militia leader publicly criticized Iraq's stance on the Iran blockade. A security guard was killed and three people injured in a shooting at an oilfield near Kirkuk. NATO held a high-level political dialogue with Iraqi officials. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE9RWXlFdm1BWS02c1pUNkRHckJ6MFVsd2daeHJTM0hUTmJNZnFNZ3NveG5Zd1ZFajJaZjJ6eXNuM2VtX0htWFViSGctR1V5cFpYTGNEN290RlNnVlZ5RnhMeWdxOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPMHlZNlVMZHgxTjhxUXVqUkRRRzFkMGhrTUpQZ25fYnB3MmdCMTVyWE9DVEFtVEEtcFozWmFjNjVXTS0ySkVWQWc5eEJlM01fbGZBN2xaeE9ZR21OWFN5R2JxeDJ6YU5yNms2RV9WNjRST1ZxZGFlazZDaHhBVE9VV0xlZEkwaFJCUTFybWtwOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxOLVp3R3Fhc3F6YkNOUHFMMGFObUFibGcwTlRHekppdjRVUlh6c240SlBNQlh3WWJuM01PY2dxOGNSY2YwanBuVU9MTjVZZmRGVmhNeE4wUGtCUm42ZFBOZTZNdGlXNGh3TkhvaXE2c1p6VUNlZTlHc2dwQ3MzMHpsc08yV1dVWUt2UkxhRm9LWTMtNFJvRlF0REhTeE9XczNqUlF5M0k1OVJDcl9BaHBqbnF5bU1XV1l2RlpSV051c2hBMXI0MzFPTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء العراقية (واع)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTFB3dlZJRDhWSTBFWWIzREo5U1dBUXVOX3p0TEdBd3M1UmFCZk96dEtqRm1wUWs1cEdQVlY3bnJCU29fNklYeHBldGZZQncxYjFDTlpYbWhTdlk2WnhFU3Z5QkUzcGtjMlNaOGhIc3Y4cG0tYldm